# Local development only (wrangler dev). Copy this file to
# .dev.vars (gitignored — never commit it) and put YOUR OWN key in the
# copy. This example holds no real value and must stay that way.
#
# In production the same name is set as a Worker secret instead:
#   wrangler secret put BASETEN_API_KEY
# (see README.md — get the value from your Baseten dashboard yourself;
# never paste it into chat, a commit, or an issue.)
BASETEN_API_KEY=placeholder-redacted-no-real-value
# Optional: only needed for the /photo route (live photo drafts).
META_API_KEY=placeholder-redacted-no-real-value
